<view class="page"
  ><demo-banner /><view class="eyebrow">PROFILE / 个人资料</view
  ><view class="title">认识用车的人。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取资料…</view
  ><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty"
    ><view>{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="reload">重新加载</button></view
  ><block wx:else
    ><view class="notice"
      >仅保存本机示例姓名、手机号与驾龄。请填写虚构信息；此页面不采集或上传身份证、驾驶证。</view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="field"
        ><view class="label">示例姓名</view
        ><input
          class="input"
          value="{{name}}"
          maxlength="30"
          placeholder="例如：演示用户"
          data-field="name"
          bindinput="input"
          disabled="{{busy}}" /></view
      ><view class="field"
        ><view class="label">示例手机号</view
        ><input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          value="{{mobile}}"
          maxlength="11"
          placeholder="11 位示例号码"
          data-field="mobile"
          bindinput="input"
          disabled="{{busy}}" /></view
      ><view class="field"
        ><view class="label">驾龄（年）</view
        ><input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          value="{{drivingYears}}"
          maxlength="2"
          placeholder="0–70"
          data-field="drivingYears"
          bindinput="input"
          disabled="{{busy}}" /></view></view
    ><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view
    ><button
      class="primary"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy || mode !== 'mock'}}"
      bindtap="submit"
      >保存示例资料</button
    ><view wx:if="{{mode !== 'mock'}}" class="notice"
      >客户资料接口尚未接入，当前模式无法保存。</view
    ></block
  ></view
>
